{"vid":"4lpaBIOCbIA","source":"4lpaBIOCbIA.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"Would you [music] trust a robot to teach"},{"t":2.5,"txt":"you how to speak? Learning a language"},{"t":4.6,"txt":"with AI is like asking a toaster for"},{"t":7,"txt":"dating advice. Sure, AI is everywhere"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"now, but you're still pressing buttons"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"and staring at a screen all by yourself."},{"t":14.4,"txt":"[music] Ask it a question, you'll get an"},{"t":16.5,"txt":"answer, but no feedback, no connection,"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"and no accountability. [music]"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"Now, imagine this instead. You're"},{"t":23.5,"txt":"learning with a real native [music]"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"speaking teacher. You say a phrase, they"},{"t":27.8,"txt":"respond and correct you, and you say it"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"perfectly on the second try."},{"t":32.1,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":32.2,"txt":">> You ask questions, they clear up your"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"confusion, and make the language easier."},{"t":37,"txt":"It's real-time, it's personal, it's how"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"language is meant to [music] be learned."},{"t":41.6,"txt":"You're not just memorizing, you're"},{"t":43.2,"txt":"speaking, laughing, and building"},{"t":45.1,"txt":"confidence, because real language is"},{"t":47.5,"txt":"human, and so is real learning. So, if"},{"t":50.3,"txt":"you want to learn with a real teacher,"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"the good news is our live group classes"},{"t":55,"txt":"are back, and there are 50 [music] spots"},{"t":56.9,"txt":"open for our next semester."},{"t":59,"txt":"Live group classes are a 10-week program"},{"t":61.5,"txt":"with weekly live 1-hour classes over"},{"t":63.7,"txt":"Zoom. You'll join up to four other"},{"t":66,"txt":"students over Zoom and learn the"},{"t":67.8,"txt":"language faster in the next 10 weeks."},{"t":70.2,"txt":"That's a full semester of practice,"},{"t":72.2,"txt":"feedback, and accountability. So, if you"},{"t":74.6,"txt":"want to join the live group classes"},{"t":76,"txt":"[music] and learn with a real teacher,"},{"t":77.9,"txt":"enroll in our upcoming semester now,"},{"t":80.1,"txt":"before all 50 spots are gone. Just click"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"the link in the description."}],"words":[{"t":0.4,"w":"Would"},{"t":0.64,"w":"you"},{"t":0.659,"w":"[music]"},{"t":0.8,"w":"trust"},{"t":1.28,"w":"a"},{"t":1.4,"w":"robot"},{"t":2.08,"w":"to"},{"t":2.2,"w":"teach"},{"t":2.52,"w":"you"},{"t":2.68,"w":"how"},{"t":2.84,"w":"to"},{"t":2.96,"w":"speak?"},{"t":3.88,"w":"Learning"},{"t":4.16,"w":"a"},{"t":4.2,"w":"language"},{"t":4.64,"w":"with"},{"t":4.88,"w":"AI"},{"t":5.28,"w":"is"},{"t":5.48,"w":"like"},{"t":5.72,"w":"asking"},{"t":6.16,"w":"a"},{"t":6.24,"w":"toaster"},{"t":6.8,"w":"for"},{"t":6.96,"w":"dating"},{"t":7.28,"w":"advice."},{"t":8.04,"w":"Sure,"},{"t":8.48,"w":"AI"},{"t":8.84,"w":"is"},{"t":9.16,"w":"everywhere"},{"t":9.76,"w":"now,"},{"t":10.4,"w":"but"},{"t":10.52,"w":"you're"},{"t":10.64,"w":"still"},{"t":11,"w":"pressing"},{"t":11.44,"w":"buttons"},{"t":11.84,"w":"and"},{"t":12,"w":"staring"},{"t":12.4,"w":"at"},{"t":12.48,"w":"a"},{"t":12.56,"w":"screen"},{"t":13.2,"w":"all"},{"t":13.56,"w":"by"},{"t":13.8,"w":"yourself."},{"t":14.41,"w":"[music]"},{"t":14.8,"w":"Ask"},{"t":15.08,"w":"it"},{"t":15.16,"w":"a"},{"t":15.2,"w":"question,"},{"t":15.88,"w":"you'll"},{"t":16.12,"w":"get"},{"t":16.36,"w":"an"},{"t":16.48,"w":"answer,"},{"t":17,"w":"but"},{"t":17.36,"w":"no"},{"t":17.6,"w":"feedback,"},{"t":18.32,"w":"no"},{"t":18.44,"w":"connection,"},{"t":19.44,"w":"and"},{"t":19.52,"w":"no"},{"t":19.64,"w":"accountability."},{"t":19.66,"w":"[music]"},{"t":20.88,"w":"Now,"},{"t":21.56,"w":"imagine"},{"t":22.04,"w":"this"},{"t":22.28,"w":"instead."},{"t":23.36,"w":"You're"},{"t":23.48,"w":"learning"},{"t":23.84,"w":"with"},{"t":24.08,"w":"a"},{"t":24.16,"w":"real"},{"t":24.88,"w":"native"},{"t":24.9,"w":"[music]"},{"t":25.24,"w":"speaking"},{"t":25.68,"w":"teacher."},{"t":26.6,"w":"You"},{"t":26.76,"w":"sa